diff --git a/docs/agents/bug_development.md b/docs/agents/bug_development.md
index 11c6994cb..6e99a5aa4 100644
--- a/docs/agents/bug_development.md
+++ b/docs/agents/bug_development.md
@@ -11,7 +11,7 @@ Configured via `customParams` in the agent JSON or the project `.dmtools/config.
 - `autoSaveCommitMessage` — optional template for the periodic WIP auto-save commit made by the timer (default `{ticketKey} WIP auto-save {timestamp}`; also `formats.commitMessage.autoSave` in the project config). Use it when the target repo's commit-msg hook requires a tracker key, e.g. `AB#{ticketKey} WIP auto-save {timestamp}`.
 - `checkOpenPR` — when `true`, skip tickets that already have an open pull request for this work.
 - `scmProvider` — SCM provider override (`github`, `gitlab`, …) for this run (autocommit timer and release snapshots route through it).
-- `developmentMode` / `developmentModeConfig` — the same execution-profile knob as story_development (see that doc for the full contract): `plan` works by a written plan protocol; `adaptive` surveys the ticket, estimates story points in-leg, and self-selects plan above `developmentModeConfig.adaptive.planThreshold` (default `3`), recording the decision in `outputs/<KEY>/scope_estimate.json` and stamping `dev-plan-escalated` on PR-comment completion.
+- `developmentMode` / `developmentModeConfig` — `default` | `plan` | `adaptive` (missing/unknown ⇒ `default`); `adaptive` = estimates in-leg, self-selects plan at `developmentModeConfig.adaptive.planThreshold` (default `3`), stamps `dev-plan-escalated`, records `outputs/<KEY>/scope_estimate.json`. Details: `docs/development-mode.md` §2.3.
 - `removeLabel` — label removed from the ticket after a successful run (idempotency cleanup).
